<title>ALBANIA: SOCCER-PORTUGAL BEAT ALBANIA 4-2 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTUGAL BEAT ALBANIA 4-2 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal beat Albania 4-2 (halftime</p>
<p>3-1) in a European under-21 soccer championship group nine</p>
<p>qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Albania - Haxhi (41st), Bogdani (73rd)</p>
<p>Portugal - Dani (4th, 18th), Beto (10th), Agostinho (90th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000</p>
